@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-5">

    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy & Usage Policy</h1>

    <p class="lead text-muted">
        ITI_System is an educational management platform designed to organize students,
        departments, and courses while ensuring secure access through a role-based
        authorization system.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-4" />

    <h4>Account Creation Policy</h4>

    <p>
        To maintain the security and integrity of the platform, account creation follows
        a controlled policy:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Students</strong> can register and create their own accounts.</li>
        <li><strong>Instructor accounts</strong> are created only by administrators.</li>
        <li><strong>Administrator accounts</strong> are created and managed by existing administrators.</li>
        <li>Users are not allowed to assign roles to themselves during registration.</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="my-4" />

    <h4>Role-Based Access Control</h4>

    <p>
        Access to system features is determined by the user's assigned role.
        Each role has specific permissions within the system.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Administrator</h5>
    <p>Administrators have full control over the system and can manage all core entities.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Courses:</strong> View, show details, add, update, and delete courses.</li>
        <li><strong>Departments:</strong> View, show details, add, update, and delete departments.</li>
        <li><strong>Students:</strong> View, add, and delete students.</li>
        <li><strong>User Management:</strong> Create new users and assign roles (Administrator or Instructor).</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Instructor</h5>
    <p>Instructors manage academic activities related to their assigned courses.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Courses:</strong> View courses, show course details, update course information, and manage student marks within the course.</li>
        <li><strong>Departments:</strong> View departments and see department details.</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Student</h5>
    <p>Students have limited access to view their academic information.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Courses:</strong> View courses and course details.</li>
        <li><strong>Departments:</strong> View departments and department details.</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="my-4" />

    <h4>Data Protection</h4>

    <p>
        ITI_System restricts access to sensitive operations using role-based authorization.
        Users are only allowed to perform actions that correspond to their assigned roles.
        All users are expected to use the platform responsibly and respect the privacy
        and academic information of others.
    </p>

</div>